 lines. We've got the freshest tips and tricks waiting for you!  <a href=\"\/blogs\/news\/transforming-artwork-into-black-only-images-for-semi-permanent-tattoos-with-pinetools\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Transforming Artwork into Black-Only Images for Semi-Permanent Tattoos with Pinetools\">HOW TO YOUR CONVERT ART WORK<\/a><\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_iVXjFJ":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"WHAT IF MY ARTWORK WON'T CONVERT TO BLACK ONLY?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>If your artwork won't convert to black only, we recommend ordering a <a href=\"\/products\/regular-classic-tattoo\" title=\"Classic Custom Tattoo\">Classic Custom Temporary Tattoo<\/a>.<\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_Jgh4VX":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"HOW LONG DO CUSTOM SEMI-PERMANENT TEMPORARY TATTOOS LAST ON SKIN?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>Our INKFINITY long-lasting tattoos are designed to provide a realistic tattoo experience for up to 2 weeks. However, the duration may vary depending on factors such as wear and care. Proper application and gentle care can contribute to extending the life of your tattoo, allowing you to enjoy the realistic look for an extended period. For optimal results, follow our application instructions.<\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_cWWgj3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"HOW TO APPLY A CUSTOM SEMI-PERMANENT TEMPORARY TATTOO?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>We recommend you follow our application instructions and pro-tips here.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.temporarytattoos.com\/pages\/inkfinity-semi-permanent-tattoo-instructions\" title=\"INKFINITY™ Semi-Permanent Tattoo Instructions\">Semi-Permanent Tattoo Application Instructions<\/a><\/p><p>Although simple! Semi-Permanent tattoo instructions differ from traditional temporary tattoo application.<\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_rciFWf":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"HOW TO REMOVE A CUSTOM SEMI-PERMANENT TEMPORARY TATTOO?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>Your semi-permanent tattoo will fade over time as your skin naturally exfoliates.<\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_4tTawi":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"WHAT COMES WITH MY CUSTOM SEMI-PERMANENT TATTOO?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>Each tattoo comes with the following items!<\/p><ul><li>Instruction Card<\/li><li>Pro-Tips<\/li><li>Boost Patch<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_NqcaAi":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"WHAT IS THE IMPRINT AND TRIM SIZE ON A SEMI-PERM CUSTOM TATTOO?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>A 1\/8” trim size margin between the printed image and the edge of the paper, on all four sides, is required for all custom temporary tattoos up to a 3” x 3\" paper size. Thus, your custom temporary tattoo itself will be ¼” smaller than the paper size selected. As an example, a 2” x 2” custom tattoo will have an imprint size of 1.75” x 1.75”. For custom tattoos on paper sizes larger than 3\" x 3\", a 3\/8” trim size margin is required between the printed image and the edge of the paper, on all four sides.<\/p><p>When producing a temporary tattoo, only your design will be printed with the artwork you provided, fitting it specifically to the tattoo paper size ordered, less trim size margins. Your design is the only thing printed, not the entire size of the tattoo sheet. This elimiates any need to die cut the paper to the size of your tattoo.<\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_43FYA4","collapsible_row_iVXjFJ","collapsible_row_Jgh4VX","collapsible_row_cWWgj3","collapsible_row_rciFWf","col